   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2020-09-14",
   "text": "Protecting the Employment Rights of Servicemembers Act\n This bill updates employment and reemployment rights of members of the uniformed services by making arbitration requirements unenforceable unless the parties consent to such arbitration in relation to employment or reemployment claims."
